      "step4Desc": "Indienen maakt een bod-token on-chain aan en vergrendelt uw ADA. U kunt annuleren nadat de vergrendelperiode is verlopen als de verkoper niet heeft geaccepteerd."
    },
    "firstBidAccepted": {
      "step1Title": "Accept This Bid",
      "step1Desc": "Clicking Accept starts a multi-stage process: your device proves ownership via a zero-knowledge proof (~3 minutes), then two chained transactions rekey the data to the buyer and release their ADA to you.",
      "step2Title": "Generating the SNARK Proof",
      "step2Desc": "Your CPU is computing a zero-knowledge proof that you own the encryption secret. This takes roughly 3 minutes and cannot be safely interrupted — feel free to leave the app open in the background.",
      "step3Title": "Submitting the Chained Re-encryption",
      "step3Desc": "The proof is now on-chain. A second transaction is chaining off the first, rekeying the encryption to the buyer so they alone can decrypt it. This step is much quicker than proving.",
      "step4Title": "Sale Complete",
      "step4Desc": "The buyer's ADA has arrived in your wallet, and the encryption is now locked to their key. Check the History tab for the transaction hashes; this listing will disappear from My Sales once confirmations settle."
