      "step1Title": "Decrypt Your Purchase",
      "step1Desc": "Click Decrypt to retrieve and unlock your content. Your wallet signature plus a local SNARK proof verify you're the rightful buyer before the data is revealed.",
      "step2Title": "SNARK Verification",
      "step2Desc": "We compute a zero-knowledge proof locally to prove ownership without exposing your keys. This runs on your machine and can take a moment.",
      "step3Title": "Saved to Library",
      "step3Desc": "Once decryption finishes, your content is saved here in the Library tab. Switch over to view, play, or export what you purchased.",
      "step4Title": "Play, Export, Relist",
      "step4Desc": "Open any item to play media, preview text/PDFs, save a copy to disk with Save As, or relist it for other buyers."
